+# web-fang-yuan
+
+English | [中文](README.zh.md)
+
+Opt-in Web-profile overlay for [`@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-fang-yuan-theme`](../../packages/client/ui-fang-yuan-theme/README.md). It enables the predeclared character-theme row without changing model, tool, persistence, or network configuration.
+
+![Fang Yuan theme preview](fang-yuan-theme-preview.png)
+
+Run it from the repository root:
+
+```sh
+pnpm dsh --profile web --patch examples/web-fang-yuan/cordis.yml
+```
+
+Opening the interface needs no model credential. Sending a model prompt retains the ordinary Web profile's credential requirements.
