+## Theme branding
+
+`ThemeBrand` renders one of six decorative seats (`wordmark`, `rail`, `hero`, `agent`, `access`, or `workspace`) from ui-theme CSS variables. It is hidden under built-in themes, contains no product state, and is always `aria-hidden`; the owning button or heading remains responsible for its localized accessible name and behavior. The Agent variant replaces only the icon because the adjacent preset name is dynamic and must continue to identify the actual selected mode.
 
